Blue still dwells there today. Blue is still clear today.

329
00:48:42,388 --> 00:48:47,678
どんな祈りも言葉も 近づけるのに 届かなかった
No matter what prayers or words I had, though I could get closer, they wouldn't reach.

330
00:48:48,288 --> 00:48:53,678
まるで 静かな恋のような 頬を伝った夏のような色のなか
It was like a quiet love, amidst the summer-like colors running down my cheek.

331
00:48:54,318 --> 00:49:00,058
きみを呪う言葉がずっと喉の奥につかえてる 「また会えるよね」って
The words cursing you have been stuck deep in my throat: 'We'll meet again, right?'

332
00:49:14,948 --> 00:49:20,048
昼下がり じめつく風の季節は
In the humid wind of early afternoon...

333
00:49:21,018 --> 00:49:26,458
想い馳せる まだ何者でもなかった僕らの肖像
Imagining our portrait when we were still nobody.

334
00:49:27,578 --> 00:49:32,328
何もかも分かち合えたはずだった
We were supposed to have shared everything.

335
00:49:32,808 --> 00:49:39,738
あの日から少しずつ きみと違う僕という呪いが肥っていく
Ever since that day, little by little, the curse of being me—so different from you—grows heavier.

336
00:49:45,748 --> 00:49:54,468
きみの笑顔の奥の憂いを 見落としたこと 悔やみ尽くして
Regretting to the end that I overlooked the sorrow deep within your smile...

337
00:50:11,712 --> 00:50:15,352
徒花と咲いて散っていくきみに
To you, who bloom as a fruitless flower and scatter,

338
00:50:15,352 --> 00:50:18,692
さよなら
Goodbye.

339
00:50:19,412 --> 00:50:22,172
今でも青が棲んでいる
Blue still dwells within me,

340
00:50:22,632 --> 00:50:25,392
今でも青は澄んでいる
Blue is still clear within me,

341
00:50:25,512 --> 00:50:30,892
どんな祈りも言葉も 近付けるのに 届かなかった
Though every prayer and word brought me closer, they couldn't reach you.

342
00:50:30,892 --> 00:50:36,592
まるで静かな恋のような 頬を伝った夏のような色のなか
Like a quiet love, within colors like summer tracing down my cheek,

343
00:50:36,592 --> 00:50:44,392
きみを呪う言葉がずっと喉の奥につかえてる 「また会えるよね」って
The words cursing you are still stuck deep in my throat... "We'll meet again, right?"

344
00:50:44,392 --> 00:50:51,472
声にならない声
A voice that cannot become words,

345
00:50:51,472 --> 00:50:57,952
無限に膨張する銀河の星の粒のように 指の隙間を零れた
Spilling like stardust from the expanding galaxy through the gaps of my fingers.

346
00:51:10,012 --> 00:51:17,492
Starlight 繋いで 繰り返してく衝動
Starlight, connecting... impulses repeating over and over.

347
00:51:19,352 --> 00:51:25,492
僕らは止まらない きらり輝いてゆけ
We won't stop, shining brightly as we go!

348
00:51:41,032 --> 00:51:45,672
踏みしめた足取りは 弾んだリズムで
Stepping firmly on the ground with a bouncing rhythm,

349
00:51:45,672 --> 00:51:50,932
キミの心の鐘を鳴らす
ringing the bell of your heart.

350
00:51:50,932 --> 00:52:01,352
光は線となって やがて形作った キャンバスの上 灯る道 満開 星明かり
Light became a line, eventually shaping a canvas with a lit path on top, under full starlight.

351
00:52:01,352 --> 00:52:10,552
迷いはない また前を向けるから
Without any hesitation, facing forward once more,

352
00:52:10,552 --> 00:52:18,672
Fly again 飛ぶんだ 導かれたこの舞台 いつか聞こえる日まで
Fly again, flying high, guided to this stage until the day I can hear it.

353
00:52:20,532 --> 00:52:30,892
空高く掲げた 手を重ね ぶっ壊した限界の その先へ
Holding up our hands high into the sky, layering them, going beyond our broken limits to that place beyond.

354
00:52:41,212 --> 00:52:50,612
思わず涙が こぼれ落ちそうな そんな夜には 連れてくよ さあ一緒に 夜空に差し込む 煌めくスターレール
On nights when tears are about to spill, I'll take you there, come on, together, the shining star rail piercing through the night sky.

355
00:52:55,052 --> 00:53:00,832
いつでも届けたい 笑顔になる歌があるから
Wanting to reach you always, because there are songs that make you smile.

356
00:53:06,352 --> 00:53:12,112
Be the star 歌おう 一面染まる金世界
Be the star, let's sing in a golden world dyeing everything.

357
00:53:12,452 --> 00:53:16,252
今もまだ焼き付いて
Still burned into my memory.

358
00:53:16,252 --> 00:53:26,892
空高く響いた 激情まだ最高潮 昨日よりも駆けるんだ 遠くまで
Resounding high in the sky, passion still at its peak, running further than yesterday, far into the distance.

359
00:53:57,112 --> 00:54:05,252
Fly again 飛ぶんだ 指先触れた結晶
Fly again, flying high, crystals touched by our fingertips.

360
00:54:06,932 --> 00:54:14,272
Be the star なるんだ キミの一等星
Be the star, becoming your first-magnitude star.

361
00:54:16,932 --> 00:54:26,652
Starlight 輝け 僕らはいつだってここにいるよ 願いよ届け
Starlight, shine on, we are always right here, may our wishes reach you.

362
00:54:27,172 --> 00:54:35,552
無限の宇宙を流れる星となって キミと僕ら照らす その先へ
Becoming a shooting star flowing through the infinite universe, illuminating you and us, heading beyond that.

363
00:54:38,972 --> 00:54:45,672
超えて 超えて 超えて
Going beyond, beyond, beyond...

364
00:54:58,272 --> 00:55:03,652
Fly again 飛ぶんだ
Fly again, flying high...

365
00:55:12,594 --> 00:55:18,494
どこまでも僕ら駆け抜けていくんだ
We'll keep running forward no matter where we go...

366
00:55:18,694 --> 00:55:23,494
傷つけて傷ついたって 明日は笑っていたいな
Even if we hurt others or get hurt, I want to smile tomorrow.

367
00:55:24,494 --> 00:55:28,894
間違いもいつかのための正解でしょ？
Our mistakes will surely lead us to the right answer someday, right?

368
00:55:29,094 --> 00:55:33,194
転んだって泣いたって 不器用でいいじゃん
Falling down and crying is fine, clumsy as we are.

369
00:55:33,294 --> 00:55:35,494
さあ行くんだ
Now let's go!

370
00:55:44,794 --> 00:55:49,494
色褪せたこの世界で 繰り返していくだけの毎日
In this fading world of repetitive everyday life,

371
00:55:49,894 --> 00:55:54,994
言えずにいた言葉を 風に乗せて1人呟いた
I whispered the words I couldn't say, carrying them on the wind.

372
00:55:55,294 --> 00:55:59,494
素直になるためには まだまだ勇気が足りないけど
I still lack the courage to be completely honest with myself,

373
00:55:59,694 --> 00:56:04,794
水しぶきあげて飛び込んだ 目をつぶりながら
but with my eyes closed, I splashed in and dove right in.

374
00:56:04,994 --> 00:56:09,694
悪天候に虹を描いて 青く塗りつぶした
I painted a rainbow across the stormy sky and colored it blue.

375
00:56:10,094 --> 00:56:15,094
扉開けて飛び出そうよ はじめましての未来へ
Let's open the door and leap out toward a brand new future!

376
00:56:15,694 --> 00:56:18,694
どこまでも僕ら駆け抜けていくんだ
We'll keep running forward no matter where we go...

377
00:56:19,094 --> 00:56:23,594
傷つけて傷ついたって 明日は笑っていたいな
Even if we hurt others or get hurt, I want to smile tomorrow.

378
00:56:24,094 --> 00:56:28,694
間違いもいつかのための正解でしょ？
Our mistakes will surely lead us to the right answer someday, right?

379
00:56:28,894 --> 00:56:32,894
転んだって泣いたって 不器用でいいじゃん
Falling down and crying is fine, clumsy as we are.

380
00:56:33,094 --> 00:56:35,494
さあ行くんだ
Now let's go!

381
00:57:22,494 --> 00:57:27,594
満天の星空を描いて 願い事をしよう
Let's paint a starry sky and make a wish.

382
00:57:27,594 --> 00:57:32,494
流れ星も描き足そうか 僕次第で変われるんだ
Let's draw shooting stars too; we can change based on ourselves.

383
00:57:35,294 --> 00:57:40,094
いつまでもこの日々が続くといいな
I hope these days will last forever.

384
00:57:40,294 --> 00:57:45,594
望んだって叶わないことだらけ でも悪くないな
Even if things don't go the way we wish, it's not so bad.

385
00:57:45,894 --> 00:57:50,794
明日へとこの歌が届くといいな
I hope this song reaches tomorrow.

386
00:57:51,094 --> 00:57:55,694
手を取って笑い合って ありのままを描いていくんだ
Holding hands and sharing smiles, we'll portray ourselves just as we are.

387
00:57:56,094 --> 00:58:00,594
どこまでも僕ら駆け抜けていくんだ
We'll keep running forward no matter where we go...

388
00:58:00,694 --> 00:58:05,594
傷つけて傷ついたって 明日は笑っていたいな
Even if we hurt others or get hurt, I want to smile tomorrow.

389
00:58:05,694 --> 00:58:10,694
間違いもいつかのための正解だから
Because every mistake is the right answer for our future.

390
00:58:11,094 --> 00:58:15,694
顔上げて走り出そう ひとりぼっちがふたりで
Lift your head and start running, from being alone to being together.

391
00:58:16,194 --> 00:58:20,194
転んだって泣いたって 不器用でいいじゃん
Falling down and crying is fine, clumsy as we are.

392
